# --- CivicConnect AI: large/generated artifacts are never committed (system design Section 49) ---
# Everything under ai/artifacts is ignored by default...
artifacts/**
!artifacts/
!artifacts/README.md
# ...except small, reviewable files: manifests, model cards, eval reports, fusion weights, fixtures.
!artifacts/*/
!artifacts/*/*/
!artifacts/**/manifest.json
!artifacts/**/MODEL_CARD.md
!artifacts/**/fusion_weights.json
!artifacts/**/b1_report.json
!artifacts/**/DATASET_MANIFEST.json
!artifacts/fixtures/
!artifacts/fixtures/**
# Large binaries are ignored even inside tracked folders (the tiny fixture is allowed above).
artifacts/civic_text_b0/**/weights.npz
artifacts/civic_text_b0/**/vocab.json
artifacts/datasets/**/*.jsonl
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.zip

# local env / secrets
.env
.env.*
kaggle.json

# python / notebooks
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
